            <hr class="section-divider" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Hi, I'm Aitor. I'm a programmer based in the Canary Islands. Right now I work at <strong>INNO-VERSE</strong>, building AI agents. Before that, I spent over a decade at <strong>PlayMedusa</strong> making games — the kind you'd find on Steam, Meta Quest, or the App Store.</p>
                <p>I used to lecture at the <strong>University of Las Palmas</strong>, teaching game programming to undergrads. I've helped out at a few community game jams and mentored startups through the <strong>Exel Gaming Accelerator</strong> in Riyadh. I recently finished a Master's in Teacher Training, which turned out to be harder than I expected.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

